# Peptix – Project Context

**What**: B2B Bestellplattform for peptides. App name: **Peptix**. Production: `https://peptix.app` (Vercel, GitHub `kreedqq/Cartwise` `main` branch).

**Stack**
- React 19 + TypeScript ~6.0 + Vite 8
- Supabase (Postgres + GoTrue Auth + Storage + Edge Functions)
- TanStack Query 5, React Router 6, Tailwind 3 + Radix UI primitives
- Vitest 4 (test runner), ESLint 10, Prettier

**Three selling areas** (DB table `shop_areas`, migration 0051):
| Key | Route | Profile | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `shop` | `/shop` | `retail` | Retail Einzelverkauf – single units only |
| `group_buy_1` | `/shop/group-buy-1` | `group_buy` | Group Buy with Kit Gesuche |
| `group_buy_2` | `/shop/group-buy-2` | `group_buy` | Second Group Buy instance |

`/kit-gesuche` redirects to the first accessible Group Buy area.

**Env vars (names only – never commit values)**
- `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`
- `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`

**Key directories**
```
src/pages/          Route screens
src/components/     UI components (shop|cart|orders|auth|admin|layout|ui|kit-requests)
src/hooks/          TanStack Query wrappers (useXxx)
src/services/       Supabase RPC / table calls (noun + verb)
src/lib/            Pure logic, utilities, constants
src/lib/shop/       Shop-area types, pricing, display, labels
src/lib/peptide/    Peptide lexicon / research (separate from shop)
src/context/        React contexts (Auth, ShopArea, NavShell)
src/types/          database.ts – hand-mirrored DB schema
supabase/migrations/ 0001–0052 SQL, sequential, never modified post-apply
```

**Separate systems – never mix**
- **Shop** (`products`, prices, carts, orders) ↔ **Lexicon** (`substances`, sources, studies).
- Lexicon UI must not render prices or cart actions.
- Shop UI must not render lexicon evidence grades or study sources.
